<title>GERMANY: Viag 9-mo pre-tax profit, sales unchanged.</title>
<headline>Viag 9-mo pre-tax profit, sales unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30</p>
<p>	  (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     1,820   unchanged</p>
<p>    Group sales			 about  32,000  unchanged</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the diversified German industrial group is Viag AG. The company said operating profit rose substantially in the first nine months but it did not give a figure.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom,,+49 69 756525</p>
